<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="en-US">

<head>
    <title>How Revaamp APA Works - RevaampAP</title>
    <meta http-equiv="Content-Type" content="text/html; charset=utf-8">
    <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1">
    <meta name="author" content="RevaampAP" />
    <meta name="description" content="Learn how Revaamp APA works - Simple and transparent process for buyers, realtors, and agents. Start finding properties and earning commissions today!" />

    <link rel="stylesheet" href="/fonts/css/switzer.css" type="text/css" media="all">
    <link rel="stylesheet" href="/fonts/css/font-awesome.min.css" type="text/css" media="all">
    <link rel="stylesheet" href="/css/plugins/bootstrap-grid.css" type="text/css" media="all">
    <link rel="stylesheet" href="/css/plugins/swiper.min.css" type="text/css" media="all">
    <link rel="stylesheet" href="/css/plugins/magnific-popup.css" type="text/css" media="all">
    <link rel="stylesheet" href="/css/style.css" type="text/css" media="all">
    <link rel="stylesheet" href="/css/custom.css" type="text/css" media="all">
    <link rel="shortcut icon" href="/favicon.ico" type="image/x-icon">
    <link rel="icon" href="/favicon.ico" type="image/x-icon">

    <style>
        .dropdown-menu { display: none; }
        .dropdown:hover .dropdown-menu,
        .dropdown .dropdown-menu.show { display: block; }

        /* ── Role Tabs ── */
        .role-tabs { margin-top: 30px; }
        .role-tabs .nav-pills {
            display: flex;
            gap: 15px;
            justify-content: center;
            flex-wrap: wrap;
        }
        .role-tabs .nav-pills .nav-link {
            padding: 15px 30px;
            border-radius: 50px;
            color: #333;
            background: #f8f9fa;
            font-weight: 600;
            transition: all 0.3s ease;
            cursor: pointer;
        }
        .role-tabs .nav-pills .nav-link i { margin-right: 10px; }
        .role-tabs .nav-pills .nav-link.active {
            background: linear-gradient(135deg, #667eea 0%, #764ba2 100%);
            color: white;
        }
        .role-tabs .nav-pills .nav-link:hover:not(.active) {
            background: #e9ecef;
            transform: translateY(-2px);
        }

        /* Tab panes */
        .tab-pane { display: none; }
        .tab-pane.active { display: block; }

        /* ── How-work cards ── */
        .how-work-box {
            background: white;
            border-radius: 20px;
            padding: 40px 30px;
            text-align: center;
            transition: all 0.3s ease;
            height: 100%;
            box-shadow: 0 5px 20px rgba(0,0,0,0.05);
        }
        .how-work-box:hover {
            transform: translateY(-10px);
            box-shadow: 0 15px 30px rgba(0,0,0,0.1);
        }
        .how-work-box span {
            width: 100px;
            height: 100px;
            background: linear-gradient(135deg, #667eea 0%, #764ba2 100%);
            display: inline-flex;
            align-items: center;
            justify-content: center;
            border-radius: 50%;
            margin-bottom: 25px;
        }
        .how-work-box span img {
            width: 50px;
            height: 50px;
            filter: brightness(0) invert(1);
        }
        .how-work-inner h3 {
            font-size: 22px;
            font-weight: 700;
            margin-bottom: 15px;
            color: #333;
        }
        .how-work-inner p { color: #666; line-height: 1.6; }

        /* ── Feature cards ── */
        .feature-card {
            background: white;
            border-radius: 16px;
            padding: 25px;
            height: 100%;
            transition: all 0.3s ease;
            box-shadow: 0 5px 20px rgba(0,0,0,0.05);
        }
        .feature-card:hover {
            transform: translateY(-5px);
            box-shadow: 0 10px 30px rgba(0,0,0,0.1);
        }
        .feature-card i { font-size: 40px; margin-bottom: 15px; }

        /* ── Benefits box ── */
        .benefits-box {
            background: white;
            border-radius: 20px;
            padding: 40px;
            box-shadow: 0 5px 30px rgba(0,0,0,0.1);
        }
        .benefits-box ul li { margin-bottom: 12px; font-size: 16px; }
        .benefits-box ul li i { margin-right: 10px; }

        /* ── Commission card ── */
        .commission-card {
            background: linear-gradient(135deg, #667eea 0%, #764ba2 100%);
            border-radius: 20px;
            padding: 40px;
        }
        .commission-item h2 {
            font-size: 48px;
            font-weight: 700;
            margin-bottom: 10px;
        }
        .commission-item p { font-size: 16px; opacity: 0.9; }

        /* ── FAQ Accordion ── */
        .faq-item {
            background: white;
            border-radius: 12px;
            margin-bottom: 15px;
            box-shadow: 0 3px 10px rgba(0,0,0,0.05);
            overflow: hidden;
        }
        .faq-question {
            width: 100%;
            text-align: left;
            padding: 20px;
            color: #333;
            font-weight: 600;
            font-size: 16px;
            background: white;
            border: none;
            cursor: pointer;
            display: flex;
            justify-content: space-between;
            align-items: center;
            transition: background 0.2s ease;
        }
        .faq-question:hover { background: #f8f9fa; }
        .faq-icon {
            font-style: normal;
            font-size: 18px;
            color: #03A6A6;
            font-weight: 700;
            flex-shrink: 0;
            margin-left: 12px;
            transition: transform 0.3s ease;
        }
        .faq-answer {
            max-height: 0;
            overflow: hidden;
            transition: max-height 0.35s ease, padding 0.35s ease;
            padding: 0 20px;
            color: #666;
            line-height: 1.6;
        }
        .faq-item.open .faq-answer {
            max-height: 300px;
            padding: 0 20px 20px;
        }
        .faq-item.open .faq-icon { transform: rotate(45deg); }

        /* ── Buttons ── */
        .thm-btn {
            display: inline-block;
            padding: 14px 35px;
            background: linear-gradient(135deg, #667eea 0%, #764ba2 100%);
            color: white;
            border-radius: 50px;
            font-weight: 600;
            transition: all 0.3s ease;
            text-decoration: none;
            border: none;
        }
        .thm-btn:hover {
            transform: translateY(-2px);
            box-shadow: 0 5px 15px rgba(102,126,234,0.4);
            color: white;
        }

        /* ── CTA Section ── */
        .cta-inner { text-align: center; }
        .cta-buttons {
            display: flex;
            gap: 20px;
            justify-content: center;
            flex-wrap: wrap;
            margin-top: 40px;
        }
        .cta-btn {
            display: inline-block;
            padding: 14px 40px;
            border-radius: 50px;
            font-weight: 600;
            font-size: 16px;
            text-decoration: none;
            transition: all 0.3s ease;
            border: 2px solid white;
            color: white;
            background: transparent;
        }
        .cta-btn:hover {
            background: white;
            color: #667eea;
        }

        /* ── Misc ── */
        .gray-bg { background: #f8f9fa; }
        .mil-banner-inner { padding: 100px 0; }
        .mil-breadcrumbs {
            list-style: none;
            padding: 0;
            margin: 0;
            display: flex;
            justify-content: center;
            gap: 10px;
        }
        .mil-breadcrumbs li:not(:last-child):after {
            content: '/';
            margin-left: 10px;
            color: #999;
        }
        .mil-breadcrumbs a { color: #999; text-decoration: none; }
        .mil-breadcrumbs a:hover { color: #03A6A6; }
        .mil-p-80-80 { padding: 80px 0; }
        .mil-mb-60 { margin-bottom: 60px; }
        .mil-mb-30 { margin-bottom: 30px; }
        .mil-up { transition: transform 0.3s ease, opacity 0.3s ease; }

        @media (max-width: 768px) {
            .role-tabs .nav-pills .nav-link {
                display: block;
                margin: 5px 0;
                text-align: center;
            }
            .how-work-box { margin-bottom: 20px; }
            .commission-item h2 { font-size: 36px; }
            .benefits-box { padding: 25px; }
            .cta-buttons { flex-direction: column; align-items: center; }
        }
    </style>
</head>

<body>

    <div id="smooth-wrapper" class="mil-wrapper">

        <div class="mil-preloader">
            <div class="mil-load"></div>
            <p class="h2 mil-mb-30"><span class="mil-light mil-counter" data-number="100">100</span><span class="mil-light">%</span></p>
        </div>

        <div class="mil-progress-track">
            <div class="mil-progress"></div>
        </div>

        <div class="progress-wrap active-progress"></div>

        <!-- top panel -->
        <div class="mil-top-panel">
            <div class="container">
                <a href="/" class="mil-logo">
                    <img src="/img/logo.png" alt="RevaampAP" width="83" height="32">
                </a>
                <nav class="mil-top-menu">
                    <ul>
                        <li><a href="/">Home</a></li>
                        <li><a href="/properties">Properties</a></li>
                        <li><a href="/how-it-works" class="mil-active">How It Works</a></li>
                        <li><a href="/about">About</a></li>
                        <li><a href="/contact">Contact</a></li>
                    </ul>
                </nav>
                <div class="mil-menu-buttons">
                    <% if (typeof user !== 'undefined' && user) { %>
                        <div class="dropdown" style="position: relative;">
                            <a href="#" class="mil-btn mil-sm dropdown-toggle" data-bs-toggle="dropdown" style="display: flex; align-items: center; gap: 8px;">
                                <i class="fa fa-user-circle" style="font-size: 18px;"></i>
                                <span><%= user.name %></span>
                                <i class="fa fa-chevron-down" style="font-size: 12px;"></i>
                            </a>
                            <ul class="dropdown-menu" style="position: absolute; right: 0; top: 100%; min-width: 220px; background: white; border-radius: 12px; box-shadow: 0 10px 30px rgba(0,0,0,0.15); padding: 10px 0; margin-top: 10px; z-index: 1000;">
                                <li><a href="/dashboard"><i class="fa fa-tachometer"></i> Dashboard</a></li>
                                <li><a href="/logout"><i class="fa fa-sign-out-alt"></i> Logout</a></li>
                            </ul>
                        </div>
                    <% } else { %>
                        <a href="/login" class="mil-btn mil-sm">Log in</a>
                        <a href="/register" class="mil-btn mil-sm mil-light">List Property</a>
                    <% } %>
                    <div class="mil-menu-btn">
                        <span></span>
                    </div>
                </div>
            </div>
        </div>
        <!-- top panel end -->

        <div id="smooth-content">

            <!-- banner -->
            <div class="mil-banner mil-banner-inner mil-dissolve">
                <div class="container">
                    <div class="row align-items-center justify-content-center">
                        <div class="col-xl-8">
                            <div class="mil-banner-text mil-text-center">
                                <div class="mil-text-m mil-mb-20 mil-up">Simple & Transparent Process</div>
                                <h1 class="mil-mb-60 mil-up">How Revaamp APA Works</h1>
                                <ul class="mil-breadcrumbs mil-pub-info mil-center mil-up">
                                    <li><a href="/">Home</a></li>
                                    <li><a href="/how-it-works">How It Works</a></li>
                                </ul>
                            </div>
                        </div>
                    </div>
                </div>
            </div>
            <!-- banner end -->

            <!-- Role Tabs -->
            <div class="mil-blog-list mil-p-80-80">
                <div class="container">
                    <div class="sec-title text-center w-100 mil-mb-60">
                        <span class="mil-text-m mil-accent mil-up">Three Ways to Use Revaamp APA</span>
                        <h2 class="mil-mb-30 mil-up">Choose Your Role</h2>
                        <p class="mil-text-m mil-soft mil-up">Whether you're looking to buy, sell, or earn commissions, we've got you covered</p>
                    </div>

                    <div class="role-tabs text-center">
                        <ul class="nav nav-pills justify-content-center" id="roleTabs">
                            <li class="nav-item">
                                <a class="nav-link active" data-tab="buyer">
                                    <i class="fa fa-home"></i> Buyers &amp; Tenants
                                </a>
                            </li>
                            <li class="nav-item">
                                <a class="nav-link" data-tab="realtor">
                                    <i class="fa fa-building"></i> Realtors
                                </a>
                            </li>
                            <li class="nav-item">
                                <a class="nav-link" data-tab="agent">
                                    <i class="fa fa-user-tie"></i> Agents
                                </a>
                            </li>
                        </ul>
                    </div>

                    <!-- Tab Content -->
                    <div class="mt-5" id="roleTabContent">

                        <!-- Buyers & Tenants -->
                        <div class="tab-pane active" id="tab-buyer">
                            <div class="row">
                                <div class="col-md-4">
                                    <div class="how-work-box mil-up">
                                        <span><img class="img-fluid" src="/assets/images/icons/search-icon.png" alt="Search"></span>
                                        <div class="how-work-inner">
                                            <h3>1. Search Properties</h3>
                                            <p>Browse thousands of verified properties across Nigeria. Filter by type, location, price, and more.</p>
                                        </div>
                                    </div>
                                </div>
                                <div class="col-md-4">
                                    <div class="how-work-box mil-up">
                                        <span><img class="img-fluid" src="/assets/images/icons/view-icon.png" alt="View"></span>
                                        <div class="how-work-inner">
                                            <h3>2. View &amp; Compare</h3>
                                            <p>View detailed property information, high-quality images, and compare multiple options side by side.</p>
                                        </div>
                                    </div>
                                </div>
                                <div class="col-md-4">
                                    <div class="how-work-box mil-up">
                                        <span><img class="img-fluid" src="/assets/images/icons/contact-icon.png" alt="Contact"></span>
                                        <div class="how-work-inner">
                                            <h3>3. Connect &amp; Close</h3>
                                            <p>Contact the realtor directly or work with an agent to schedule viewings and complete your transaction.</p>
                                        </div>
                                    </div>
                                </div>
                            </div>
                            <div class="row mt-5">
                                <div class="col-md-6">
                                    <div class="feature-card mil-up">
                                        <i class="fa fa-check-circle" style="color: #28a745;"></i>
                                        <h4>Verified Properties</h4>
                                        <p>All properties on our platform are verified by our team to ensure authenticity and accuracy.</p>
                                    </div>
                                </div>
                                <div class="col-md-6">
                                    <div class="feature-card mil-up">
                                        <i class="fa fa-shield-alt" style="color: #03A6A6;"></i>
                                        <h4>Secure Transactions</h4>
                                        <p>Your payments and personal information are protected with industry-standard security.</p>
                                    </div>
                                </div>
                            </div>
                        </div>

                        <!-- Realtors -->
                        <div class="tab-pane" id="tab-realtor">
                            <div class="row">
                                <div class="col-md-4">
                                    <div class="how-work-box mil-up">
                                        <span><img class="img-fluid" src="/assets/images/icons/register-icon.png" alt="Register"></span>
                                        <div class="how-work-inner">
                                            <h3>1. Create Account</h3>
                                            <p>Register as a realtor for free. Provide your company details and get verified by our team.</p>
                                        </div>
                                    </div>
                                </div>
                                <div class="col-md-4">
                                    <div class="how-work-box mil-up">
                                        <span><img class="img-fluid" src="/assets/images/icons/list-icon.png" alt="List"></span>
                                        <div class="how-work-inner">
                                            <h3>2. List Properties</h3>
                                            <p>Add unlimited properties with detailed information, high-quality images, and videos.</p>
                                        </div>
                                    </div>
                                </div>
                                <div class="col-md-4">
                                    <div class="how-work-box mil-up">
                                        <span><img class="img-fluid" src="/assets/images/icons/lead-icon.png" alt="Leads"></span>
                                        <div class="how-work-inner">
                                            <h3>3. Get Leads</h3>
                                            <p>Receive inquiries from potential buyers and tenants. Track views and engagement.</p>
                                        </div>
                                    </div>
                                </div>
                            </div>
                            <div class="benefits-box mt-5 mil-up">
                                <h3 class="text-center mb-4">Why List with Revaamp APA?</h3>
                                <div class="row">
                                    <div class="col-md-4">
                                        <ul class="list-unstyled">
                                            <li><i class="fa fa-check-circle" style="color: #28a745;"></i> Free to list</li>
                                            <li><i class="fa fa-check-circle" style="color: #28a745;"></i> Unlimited properties</li>
                                            <li><i class="fa fa-check-circle" style="color: #28a745;"></i> Verified leads</li>
                                        </ul>
                                    </div>
                                    <div class="col-md-4">
                                        <ul class="list-unstyled">
                                            <li><i class="fa fa-check-circle" style="color: #28a745;"></i> Analytics dashboard</li>
                                            <li><i class="fa fa-check-circle" style="color: #28a745;"></i> Agent network access</li>
                                            <li><i class="fa fa-check-circle" style="color: #28a745;"></i> Featured opportunities</li>
                                        </ul>
                                    </div>
                                    <div class="col-md-4">
                                        <ul class="list-unstyled">
                                            <li><i class="fa fa-check-circle" style="color: #28a745;"></i> 24/7 support</li>
                                            <li><i class="fa fa-check-circle" style="color: #28a745;"></i> Marketing tools</li>
                                            <li><i class="fa fa-check-circle" style="color: #28a745;"></i> Performance insights</li>
                                        </ul>
                                    </div>
                                </div>
                                <div class="text-center mt-4">
                                    <a href="/register" class="thm-btn">Start Listing Today</a>
                                </div>
                            </div>
                        </div>

                        <!-- Agents -->
                        <div class="tab-pane" id="tab-agent">
                            <div class="row">
                                <div class="col-md-4">
                                    <div class="how-work-box mil-up">
                                        <span><img class="img-fluid" src="/assets/images/icons/agent-register-icon.png" alt="Register"></span>
                                        <div class="how-work-inner">
                                            <h3>1. Register &amp; Pay Fee</h3>
                                            <p>Pay a one-time registration fee of ₦5,000 to become a verified agent.</p>
                                        </div>
                                    </div>
                                </div>
                                <div class="col-md-4">
                                    <div class="how-work-box mil-up">
                                        <span><img class="img-fluid" src="/assets/images/icons/referral-icon.png" alt="Referral"></span>
                                        <div class="how-work-inner">
                                            <h3>2. Get Unique Links</h3>
                                            <p>Receive unique referral links for each property to share on social media.</p>
                                        </div>
                                    </div>
                                </div>
                                <div class="col-md-4">
                                    <div class="how-work-box mil-up">
                                        <span><img class="img-fluid" src="/assets/images/icons/earn-icon.png" alt="Earn"></span>
                                        <div class="how-work-inner">
                                            <h3>3. Earn 70% Commission</h3>
                                            <p>Earn 70% of the agency fee on every successful transaction from your referrals.</p>
                                        </div>
                                    </div>
                                </div>
                            </div>
                            <div class="commission-card mt-5 text-white text-center mil-up">
                                <h3 class="mb-4">Commission Structure</h3>
                                <div class="row">
                                    <div class="col-md-4">
                                        <div class="commission-item">
                                            <h2 class="text-warning">70%</h2>
                                            <p>Agent Commission</p>
                                        </div>
                                    </div>
                                    <div class="col-md-4">
                                        <div class="commission-item">
                                            <h2 class="text-info">10%</h2>
                                            <p>Promoter (Realtor)</p>
                                        </div>
                                    </div>
                                    <div class="col-md-4">
                                        <div class="commission-item">
                                            <h2 class="text-light">20%</h2>
                                            <p>Revaamp APA Platform</p>
                                        </div>
                                    </div>
                                </div>
                                <p class="mt-4 mb-0">Example: On a ₦100,000 agency fee, you earn ₦70,000!</p>
                            </div>
                            <div class="text-center mt-5">
                                <a href="/agent/register" class="thm-btn">Become an Agent Today</a>
                            </div>
                        </div>

                    </div><!-- /tab-content -->
                </div>
            </div>

            <!-- FAQ Section -->
            <div class="gray-bg mil-p-80-80">
                <div class="container">
                    <div class="sec-title text-center w-100 mil-mb-60">
                        <span class="mil-text-m mil-accent mil-up">Got Questions?</span>
                        <h2 class="mil-mb-30 mil-up">Frequently Asked Questions</h2>
                    </div>
                    <div class="row justify-content-center">
                        <div class="col-lg-8">

                            <div class="faq-item mil-up">
                                <button class="faq-question" type="button">
                                    Is it really free for realtors to list properties?
                                    <span class="faq-icon">+</span>
                                </button>
                                <div class="faq-answer">
                                    Yes! Realtors can create an account and list properties completely free. There are no listing fees or hidden charges.
                                </div>
                            </div>

                            <div class="faq-item mil-up">
                                <button class="faq-question" type="button">
                                    How do agents earn commissions?
                                    <span class="faq-icon">+</span>
                                </button>
                                <div class="faq-answer">
                                    Agents get unique referral links for each property. When someone clicks your link and completes a transaction, you earn 70% of the agency fee. The payment is automatically processed and added to your wallet.
                                </div>
                            </div>

                            <div class="faq-item mil-up">
                                <button class="faq-question" type="button">
                                    What is the agent registration fee?
                                    <span class="faq-icon">+</span>
                                </button>
                                <div class="faq-answer">
                                    The one-time registration fee is ₦5,000. This fee is fully refundable if your application is not approved. It covers account setup, verification, and access to our agent network.
                                </div>
                            </div>

                            <div class="faq-item mil-up">
                                <button class="faq-question" type="button">
                                    How are properties verified?
                                    <span class="faq-icon">+</span>
                                </button>
                                <div class="faq-answer">
                                    Our team manually reviews each property listing to ensure accuracy and authenticity. We verify ownership documents, property details, and images before publishing.
                                </div>
                            </div>

                            <div class="faq-item mil-up">
                                <button class="faq-question" type="button">
                                    Can I be both a realtor and an agent?
                                    <span class="faq-icon">+</span>
                                </button>
                                <div class="faq-answer">
                                    Yes! You can have both accounts, but they must be separate. You can list your own properties as a realtor and also promote other properties as an agent to earn additional commissions.
                                </div>
                            </div>

                        </div>
                    </div>
                </div>
            </div>

            <!-- CTA Section -->
            <div class="mil-cta mil-up">
                <div class="container">
                    <div class="mil-out-frame mil-p-80-80" style="background: linear-gradient(135deg, #667eea 0%, #764ba2 100%);">
                        <div class="cta-inner">
                            <h2 class="mil-up" style="color: white; margin-bottom: 20px;">Ready to Get Started?</h2>
                            <p class="mil-text-m mil-up" style="color: rgba(255,255,255,0.85); margin-bottom: 0;">
                                Join thousands of Nigerians finding their dream properties and earning commissions daily.
                            </p>
                            <div class="cta-buttons mil-up">
                                <a href="/register" class="cta-btn">List a Property</a>
                                <a href="/agent/register" class="cta-btn">Become an Agent</a>
                            </div>
                        </div>
                    </div>
                </div>
